    },
    {
      "id": "hjwfqamw",
      "title": "Reflection",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "w226l5xo",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "77gsu3s1",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The lesson wasn't about cards or pricing. It was that the fastest way to move a metric is often to fix a mental-model mismatch, the product describing the world one way while its users live in another."
              },
              {
                "id": "eaensbfi",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "And the fastest way to ship that fix is to bring stakeholders evidence rather than taste, then give them a solution that includes how they work instead of overriding it."
              },
              {
                "id": "kh2gnbfn",
                "kind": "button",
                "label": "See it live",
                "href": "https://www.nawy.com/"
